        "Wudu is the spiritual and physical purification required before standing in prayer.\n\nThe Quran establishes four obligatory pillars (Fara'id) in Surah Al-Ma'idah (5:6):\n1. Washing the face from forehead to chin and ear to ear.\n2. Washing both arms including the elbows.\n3. Wiping at least a quarter of the head with wet hands (Hanafi; Sunnat is wiping the whole head).\n4. Washing both feet up to and including the ankles.\n\nProphetic Sunnahs (Recommended Practices):\n- Starting with Bismillah and intention (Niyyah) in the heart.\n- Washing the hands thrice up to wrists.\n- Rinsing the mouth (Madmadah) and cleaning the nose (Istinshaq) thrice.\n- Running wet fingers through the beard and between fingers and toes (Takhlil).\n- Maintaining sequential order (Tartib) without prolonged interruption (Muwalat)." to "Tahorat namozda turishdan oldin zarur bo'ladigan ruhiy va jismoniy poklanishdir.\n\nQur'on Moida surasida (5:6) to'rtta farz ustunni (Faroid) o'rnatgan:\n1. Yuzni peshonadan iyakgacha, quloqdan quloqgacha yuvish.\n2. Ikki qo‘lni tirsaklar bilan birga yuvish.\n3. Boshning kamida to‘rtdan bir qismini ho‘l qo‘l bilan artish (Hanafiy; sunnat butun boshga masxara qilishdir).\n4. Ikki oyoqni to‘piqgacha va to‘pig‘igacha yuvish.\n\nPayg‘ambarlik sunnatlari (Tavsiya etilgan amallar):\n- Bismillah va qalbdagi niyat (niyoh) bilan boshlash.\n- Qo'lni bilakgacha uch marta yuvish.\n- Og'izni chayish (Madmada) va burunni (Istinshoq) uch marta tozalash.\n- Ho'l barmoqlarni soqoldan o'tkazib, barmoq va oyoq barmoqlari orasiga yugurtirish (Taxlil).\n- uzoq vaqt uzilishlarsiz ketma-ket tartibni saqlash (Tartib).",
        "Khushu' is inner humility, stillness of the limbs, and attentive contemplation of what one is reciting.\n\nPractical Anchors for Khushu':\n- Prepare before the Takbir: Perform wudu mindfully, arrive before iqamah, and eliminate immediate physical distractions.\n- Contemplate the Words: Recite slowly (Tartil). When saying 'Al-Hamdu lillahi Rabbil-Alameen', remember Allah responds directly: 'My servant has praised Me' (Sahih Muslim 395).\n- Fix the Gaze: Direct your gaze respectfully at the place of prostration (Sujud), rather than looking around.\n- Remember the Final Prayer: The Prophet (peace be upon him) advised: 'Pray as if it were your farewell prayer' (Sunan Ibn Majah 4171)." to "Xushu’ — botiniy kamtarlik, a’zolarning sukunati va o‘qiyotgan narsaga diqqat bilan tafakkur qilishdir.\n\nXushu uchun amaliy langarlar:\n- Takbirdan oldin tayyorgarlik ko'ring: tahoratni diqqat bilan oling, iqomatdan oldin keling va darhol jismoniy chalg'itadigan narsalarni yo'q qiling.\n- So'zlarni o'ylab ko'ring: sekin o'qing (Tartil). “Al-Hamdu lillahi Rabbil-alamin” deganda, Alloh taolo to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri: “Bandam Menga hamd aytdi” (Sahih Muslim 395) deb javob berishini yodda tuting.\n- Nigohni to'g'rilang: nigohingizni atrofga qarashdan ko'ra hurmat bilan sajda qilingan joyga (Sujud) qarating.\n- Oxirgi namozni eslang: Nabiy sollallohu alayhi vasallam: «Vidolashuv namozi kabi namoz o'qing», deb nasihat qilganlar (Sundan Ibn Moja 4171).",
        "The Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) said: 'Jibril kept enjoining good treatment of the neighbor upon me until I thought he would assign him a share of inheritance.' (Sahih al-Bukhari 6014).\n\nIslamic teachings identify three classes of neighbors:\n1. A neighbor who is a relative and Muslim: has three rights (kinship, Islam, neighborhood).\n2. A neighbor who is Muslim: has two rights (Islam and neighborhood).\n3. A neighbor of different faith: has the sacred right of good neighborhood and kindness.\n\nHarm to neighbors is strictly condemned: 'By Allah he does not believe... whose neighbor is not safe from his harm.' (Sahih al-Bukhari 6016)." to "Payg'ambarimiz Muhammad sollallohu alayhi vasallam: «Jibril alayhissalom menga qo'shnimga yaxshi muomala qilishni buyurar edilar, toki men unga merosdan ulush beradi, deb o'yladim», dedilar. (Sahih al-Buxoriy 6014).\n\nIslom ta'limotlari qo'shnilarning uchta toifasini belgilaydi:\n1. Qarindosh va musulmon bo‘lgan qo‘shni: uch haqli (qarindoshlik, islom, mahalla).\n2. Musulmon bo‘lgan qo‘shni: ikki haqli (islom va mahalla).\n3. Turli e'tiqodli qo'shni: yaxshi qo'shnichilik va mehr-oqibatning muqaddas huquqiga ega.\n\nQo'shniga yomonlik qilish qat'iy qoralanadi: \"Allohga qasamki, u iymon keltirmaydi... kimning qo'shnisi uning zararidan omon bo'lmasa\". (Sahih al-Buxoriy 6016).",
